sequenceDiagram
participant Job as "dateTrackerJob: Control"
participant Service as "inventoryExpirySweepService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
participant Notify as "notificationService: Service"
Job->>+Service: runExpirySweep(currentTime)
Service->>+DB: Read active batches and expiry dates
DB-->>-Service: Near-expiry and expired candidates
Service->>DB: Update eligibility/expiry health and audit
Service->>Notify: publishNearExpiryOrExpiredEvent()
Notify->>DB: Persist scoped notification/outbox message
Service-->>-Job: Sweep result
Note over Service,DB: Expired or disposed batches are excluded from allocation.

